# Research-IDE: Full Analysis, Bug Report & Transformation Plan

## Project Overview

Research-IDE is a full-stack AI-powered research assistant with a **7-step pipeline**: Intent Extraction → Paper Retrieval → Gap Analysis → Idea Generation → Execution Planning → Code Generation → Report Writing.

**Stack:** FastAPI (Python) backend + Next.js 14 (TypeScript/Tailwind) frontend + SQLite database.

---

## 1. Complete Codebase Architecture Map

### Backend (`backend/`)
| Layer | Path | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Entry** | `main.py` | FastAPI app, CORS, middleware, router registration |
| **Config** | `core/config.py` | Pydantic settings from `.env` |
| **Database** | `core/database.py` | SQLAlchemy engine + `get_db()` |
| **Security** | `core/security.py` | bcrypt hashing, JWT, Fernet key encryption |
| **LLM Client** | `core/llm_client.py` | Unified multi-provider LLM (OpenAI, Anthropic, Groq, Gemini, Cohere, Ollama, OpenRouter) |
| **PDF Extractor** | `core/pdf_extractor.py` | ar5iv HTML + PyMuPDF PDF text extraction |
| **Quality Gate** | `core/quality_gate.py` | Validates gap/idea depth (min chars, refs) |
| **Utilities** | `core/utils.py` | JSON parser, scoring, rate limiter |
| **Models** | `models/project.py` | `Project`, `Output`, `PaperCache` SQLAlchemy models |
| **Models** | `models/user.py` | `User` model with encrypted LLM keys |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/auth.py` | Register, login, refresh, profile |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/project.py` | CRUD projects |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/pipeline.py` | Intent extraction, paper retrieval |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/agents.py` | Gaps, ideas, plan, code, report, download |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/llm_config.py` | API key management, model preferences |
| **Routes** | `api/routes/export.py` | Full ZIP project export |
| **Agents** | `agents/gap_miner/gap_agent.py` | 3-pass gap analysis (claims → gaps → scoring) |
| **Agents** | `agents/idea_generator/idea_agent.py` | Critic-Defender adversarial idea generation |
| **Agents** | `agents/planner/planner_agent.py` | 2-pass execution planning |
| **Agents** | `agents/code_agent/code_agent.py` | 12-file code scaffold generation |
| **Agents** | `agents/writer/writer_agent.py` | IEEE-format research paper generation |
| **Services** | `services/intent/intent_service.py` | LLM-powered intent extraction |
| **Services** | `services/retrieval/retrieval_service.py` | Multi-source paper retrieval (arXiv, S2, OpenAlex, PwC) |
| **Services** | `services/export_service.py` | DOCX/PDF generation (python-docx, WeasyPrint) |

### Frontend (`frontend/`)
| Layer | Path | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Layout** | `app/layout.tsx`, `app/(app)/layout.tsx` | Root + auth-guarded layouts |
| **Auth** | `app/auth/login/page.tsx`, `register/page.tsx` | Login/register forms |
| **Dashboard** | `app/(app)/dashboard/page.tsx` | Project list, quick actions |
| **New Project** | `app/(app)/projects/new/page.tsx` | Create project form |
| **Project Layout** | `app/(app)/projects/[id]/layout.tsx` | 7-step sidebar navigation |
| **Step 1** | `projects/[id]/input/page.tsx` | Intent extraction UI |
| **Step 2** | `projects/[id]/papers/page.tsx` | Paper explorer with filters |
| **Step 3** | `projects/[id]/gaps/page.tsx` | Gap analysis viewer |
| **Step 4** | `projects/[id]/ideas/page.tsx` | Idea cards with scores |
| **Step 5** | `projects/[id]/planner/page.tsx` | Execution plan viewer (SSE streaming) |
| **Step 6** | `projects/[id]/code/page.tsx` | Code file browser (SSE streaming) |
| **Step 7** | `projects/[id]/report/page.tsx` | IEEE paper viewer + downloads |
| **Settings** | `settings/llm/page.tsx` | Multi-provider AI config |
| **Settings** | `settings/profile/page.tsx` | Profile editor |
| **Components** | `components/layout/Sidebar.tsx` | Main navigation sidebar |
| **Store** | `store/useAuthStore.ts` | Zustand auth state |
| **API** | `services/api.ts` | Axios client + SSE streaming |

