## 2. Identified Bugs

### Backend Bugs

| # | Severity | File | Bug | Fix |
|---|----------|------|-----|-----|
| B1 | 🔴 Critical | `agents.py:245` | `re` is imported at module level for plan stream but NOT for code stream — `re.search` will crash | Add `import re` or use the existing `json_lib` alias |
| B2 | 🟡 Medium | `gap_agent.py:172` | `_summarize_papers` truncates abstracts to 200 chars — the gap analysis only sees snippets, not full text | Increase to at least 500 chars or use `pdf_extractor` |
| B3 | 🟡 Medium | `pdf_extractor.py` | `extract_full_text()` exists but is **never called** by any agent. All agents only see `paper["abstract"]` | Wire `extract_full_text` into the pipeline |
| B4 | 🟡 Medium | `quality_gate.py` | Exists but is **never imported or used** by any agent | Integrate into gap_agent and idea_agent |
| B5 | 🟡 Medium | `retrieval_service.py:59` | `_relevance_score` ignores words ≤3 chars (e.g., "NLP", "AI", "ML", "GAN") | Match the intent_service approach for short research terms |
| B6 | 🟠 Low | `project.py (model)` | `PaperCache` table exists but is **never written to** — papers are fetched every time | Implement caching in retrieval_service |
| B7 | 🟠 Low | `security.py:39,48` | `datetime.utcnow()` is deprecated in Python 3.12+ | Use `datetime.now(timezone.utc)` |
| B8 | 🟠 Low | `llm_client.py:457` | `test_connection` passes `max_tokens=10` as kwarg but `complete()` doesn't accept it — it's ignored silently | Fix the test_connection method signature |
| B9 | 🟠 Low | `export.py:186` | OpenAlex `mailto` is hardcoded as `research@ide.app` — fake email | Make configurable or use a real contact |
| B10 | 🟠 Low | `code_agent.py:245` | Code stream doesn't import `re` but references it in the route file | See B1 — this is the same root cause |
| B11 | 🟡 Medium | `writer_agent.py` | Fallback report doesn't include `[N]` citation markers in text — references exist but aren't cited | Add `[N]` markers to fallback section content |

### Frontend Bugs

| # | Severity | File | Bug | Fix |
|---|----------|------|-----|-----|
| F1 | 🟡 Medium | `planner/page.tsx` | Auto-triggers plan streaming on mount even if user navigates manually — no way to regenerate | Add explicit "Generate Plan" button when no plan exists |
| F2 | 🟡 Medium | `code/page.tsx` | Same auto-trigger issue — auto-streams code on mount | Add explicit trigger with button |
| F3 | 🟡 Medium | `report/page.tsx:20` | Auto-generates report if not found — `loading` set to `false` before generation completes | Fix loading state management |
| F4 | 🟠 Low | `papers/page.tsx:87-96` | Filter sidebar only checks `arxiv` and `semantic_scholar` — misses `openalex` and `paperswithcode` | Dynamically compute source filter list |
| F5 | 🟠 Low | `dashboard/page.tsx:134` | `formatDistanceToNow` may crash if `updated_at` is null | Add null check |
| F6 | 🟠 Low | `report/page.tsx:52` | Accesses `useAuthStore.getState()` directly in async handler — works but isn't reactive pattern best practice | Fine for now, document |

