## 4. Features to REMOVE

| Feature | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| **Code Generation Page** (Step 6) | Replace with detailed Research Guide + PPT page — code generation is too generic and not useful for most research |
| **Code Generation Agent** (`code_agent.py`) | Remove after replacement is built |
| **Code Streaming Endpoints** | No longer needed |

---

## 5. New Pipeline (After Transformation)

```
Step 1: NLP Analysis (Intent Extraction)
Step 2: Paper Explorer (Full-Text Retrieval + Caching)
Step 3: Gap Analysis (Using Full Paper Text)
Step 4: Research Ideas (Critic-Defender Loop)
Step 5: Execution Plan (Enhanced + Dynamic)
Step 6: Research Guide & Presentation (NEW — replaces Code)
Step 7: Research Paper (IEEE Report + Downloads)
```

---

## 6. Proposed Execution Order

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a large transformation. I recommend executing in waves:

### Wave 1: Bug Fixes (1 session)
1. Fix `re` import bug in `agents.py` (B1/B10)
2. Wire `quality_gate.py` into agents (B4)
3. Fix paper source filter in frontend (F4)
4. Fix deprecated `datetime.utcnow()` (B7)
5. Fix `test_connection` signature (B8)
6. Fix auto-trigger issues in planner/code/report pages (F1-F3)

### Wave 2: Full Paper Extraction (1-2 sessions)
1. Integrate `pdf_extractor` into retrieval pipeline
2. Implement `PaperCache` write/read logic
3. Feed full text to gap_agent and idea_agent
4. Update paper explorer UI to show full text status

### Wave 3: Replace Code → Research Guide (2-3 sessions)
1. Build `research_guide_agent.py` (generates project report, methodology, tools)
2. Build `presentation_agent.py` (generates slide content + PPTX export)
3. Build new frontend Research Guide page
4. Remove code_agent and code page
5. Update pipeline navigation

### Wave 4: Enhanced Execution Plan (1-2 sessions)
1. Enhance planner_agent prompts for richer output
2. Build dynamic timeline UI component
3. Add resource/budget/risk detail panels

### Wave 5: Auto-Pipeline & Chat (2-3 sessions)
1. Build orchestrator endpoint for full-pipeline execution
2. Add WebSocket-based progress tracking
3. Build chat endpoint with RAG over paper texts
4. Build chat UI component

